# Cloud backend image for the production multi-tenant stack (project onyx-saas): v4.8.4 with
# product/deploy/backend-patch (platform model and knowledge rules for every new company).
# vm-bootstrap.sh saas_prepare writes it as ONYX_BACKEND_IMAGE into the saas .env and stops
# while it is empty. make-env.sh and deploy-remote.sh do not read this key.
